mode: "100644"
text: "# Editions, repurposing + two worked examples\n\n## Edition structure (scannable, mobile-first)\n```\nSUBJECT: short, specific, honest (A/B test it)\nHOOK: 1-2 lines — why this edition matters now\nBODY: one core idea, digestible chunks, subheads + short paragraphs (70% value)\nPERSONAL: a short story/POV (20%) — the personality moat\nONE CTA: reply, click, or a soft offer (10%) — not three asks\nP.S.: an extra hook / reply prompt (often the most-read line)\n```\nWin **edition 2** (the weeks 2–3 churn window): make it your single most valuable send.\n\n## Welcome sequence (retention)\n1. Deliver the lead magnet + set the promise (what/when they'll get). 2. Edition 2 = your best work.\n3. Milestone recognition + subscriber spotlights turn readers into participants. Respond to every reply.\n\n## The social ↔ email repurposing engine (both ways)\n- **Edition → social (1 → a week):** core idea → a short video (`reels-script`/`ai-video`), 3–5\n  carousels (`carousel-writer`), 8–10 captions/hooks (`caption-writer`/`hook-writer`), a LinkedIn post.\n  Route via `cross-platform-repurposing`; evergreen ones via `content-recycling`.\n- **Social → edition:** your best-performing posts/themes (from `analytics-and-reporting`) become the\n  next edition's spine. The newsletter is both a **destination and a content hub.**\n\n## Platform cheat-sheet (advisory; choose by goal)\n| Goal | Pick | Note |\n|---|---|---|\n| Newsletter as a business | **beehiiv** | growth + monetization stack; free to 2,500; Stripe-only fee |\n| Quick start + discovery | **Substack** | easy, network effects; ~10% cut on paid |\n| B2B / personal brand | **LinkedIn native** | discovery + profile integration; pair with an ESP |\n| Automation / commerce | **Kit / MailerLite / ActiveCampaign** | tagging, sequences, CRM |\nOwn your **domain + list** for portability.\n\n## Worked example 1 — signup-driving social + edition (blunt indie-founder voice)\n```\nSOCIAL (drives signups): \"I save freelancers ~30% on tax. Free 1-page checklist + a weekly note. Link in bio.\" \nEDITION 1 subject: \"The 30% rule\" -> hook -> the rule + 2 steps (value) -> a short founder aside -> CTA: \"reply with your setup\".\nWELCOME: deliver the checklist; edition 2 = the full system. MEASURE: signups + clicks from the ESP. -> link-in-bio-and-traffic\n```\n\n## Worked example 2 — repurpose one edition into a week (warm studio voice)\n```\nEDITION: \"Calm bookkeeping: the one rule we give every client.\"\n-> Reel (the rule, 20s), 1 carousel (the steps), 3 captions, 1 LinkedIn post, 1 Story poll.\nSCHEDULE: stagger over the week via scheduling-and-queue -> WoopSocial. BEST POST -> seed next edition.\n```\n\nBoth: read brand/voice/pillars first; one problem/one reader; capture from social; 70-20-10; loop both\nways; measured by clicks/replies/signups from the ESP (never opens-as-vanity, never fabricated).\n"
